+++ b/CHANGELOG_BP-074.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# BP-074 – core assets and memory closure
+
+- Freezes the common/CRC, filesystem/PACK, WAD, BSP/MDL/SPR and zone/hunk/cache contract.
+- Adds 24 allocator and closure fixtures plus a four-file retail evidence program.
+- Uses exact Quake one-byte names for hunk/cache metadata.
+- Adds contract fingerprint `0x6c8d974d` and status `core_assets_memory_109_frozen_v1`.
